{"route":"/sobre/","hash":"9d9148283a94f822ff54519e39bd0b89ce500297fcc13ab94f2e8e3d85bc4014","styles":["\n    .sc-placeholder{background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 8%,transparent);\n      border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 50%,transparent);\n      border-radius:2px;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden}\n    @keyframes sc-shine{0%{background-position:100% 50%}100%{background-position:0% 50%}}\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-placeholder,\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-interp.sc-missing{position:relative;\n      background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 5%,transparent);\n      border-color:transparent}\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-placeholder::before,\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-interp.sc-missing::before{content:'';\n      position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;\n      background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(217,119,87,0) 25%,rgba(247,225,211,.95) 37%,rgba(217,119,87,0) 63%);\n      background-size:400% 100%;animation:sc-shine 1.4s ease infinite}\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-placeholder:nth-child(n+9 of .sc-placeholder)::before,\n    html.sc-dc-streaming .sc-interp.sc-missing:nth-child(n+9 of .sc-interp.sc-missing)::before{animation:none;\n      background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 8%,transparent)}\n    .sc-placeholder-error{padding:4px 8px;font:11px/1.4 ui-monospace,monospace;\n      color:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 70%,transparent);word-break:break-word}\n    .sc-interp.sc-missing{display:inline-block;width:2em;height:1em;overflow:hidden;\n      vertical-align:text-bottom;background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.5);\n      border-radius:2px;box-sizing:border-box;color:transparent;\n      user-select:none}\n    .sc-interp.sc-unresolved{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:.85em;\n      color:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 50%,transparent);\n      background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 10%,transparent);border-radius:3px;\n      padding:0 3px}\n    .sc-host.sc-has-error{position:relative}\n    .sc-logic-error{position:absolute;top:8px;left:8px;z-index:2147483647;max-width:60ch;\n      padding:6px 10px;background:#b00020;color:#fff;font:12px/1.4 ui-monospace,monospace;\n      border-radius:4px;white-space:pre-wrap;pointer-events:none}\n    /* Mirrors PRINT_BASELINE_CSS in apps/web deck-stage-export.ts — keep both\n       in sync until dc-runtime regains a build step. */\n    @media print {\n      @page { margin: 0.5cm; }\n      figure, table { break-inside: avoid; }\n      #dc-root, #dc-root > .sc-host { height: auto; }\n      *, *::before, *::after {\n        print-color-adjust: exact; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;\n        backdrop-filter: none !important; -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;\n        animation-delay: -99s !important; animation-duration: .001s !important;\n        animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; animation-fill-mode: both !important;\n        animation-play-state: running !important; transition-duration: 0s !important;\n      }\n    }\n  ",".scp0:hover { opacity: 1 !important; }\n.scp1:hover { transform: translateY(-3px) !important; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--color-accent-700),var(--shadow-md) !important; }\n.scp2:hover { color: var(--color-text) !important; }","html,body{height:100%;margin:0}#dc-root,#dc-root>.sc-host{height:100%}"],"body":"<div class=\"sc-host\" data-sc-name=\"Root\"><nav data-dc-tpl=\"5\" class=\"nav\" style=\"position: fixed; top: 0px; left: 0px; right: 0px; z-index: 50; box-sizing: border-box; height: 56px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px; box-shadow: 0 1px 0 color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 6%,transparent); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; padding: 14px clamp(20px, 5vw, 72px); background: color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-bg) 82%,transparent); backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\"><a data-dc-tpl=\"6\" href=\"../\" style=\"flex: 0 0 auto;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"7\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Intelium\" style=\"display: block; height: 24px; width: 156px; background: var(--img-logo,url(../assets/ui/logo.png)) center/contain no-repeat;\"></span></a><input data-dc-tpl=\"8\" type=\"checkbox\" id=\"nav-toggle\" class=\"nav-toggle\" aria-label=\"Menu\"><label data-dc-tpl=\"9\" for=\"nav-toggle\" class=\"nav-burger\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg data-dc-tpl=\"10\" class=\"ic-menu\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path data-dc-tpl=\"11\" d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"></path></svg><svg data-dc-tpl=\"12\" class=\"ic-x\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path data-dc-tpl=\"13\" d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"></path></svg></label><div data-dc-tpl=\"14\" class=\"nav-links\"><a data-dc-tpl=\"15\" href=\"../sobre/\" style=\"color: var(--color-text);\">Sobre</a><a data-dc-tpl=\"16\" href=\"../servicos/\" style=\"color: var(--color-neutral-200);\">Serviços</a><a data-dc-tpl=\"17\" href=\"../cases/\" style=\"color: var(--color-neutral-200);\">Cases</a><a data-dc-tpl=\"18\" href=\"../labs/\" style=\"color: var(--color-neutral-200);\">Labs</a><a data-dc-tpl=\"19\" href=\"../eventos/\" style=\"color: var(--color-neutral-200);\">Eventos</a><a data-dc-tpl=\"20\" href=\"../academy/\" style=\"color: var(--color-neutral-200);\">Academy</a><a data-dc-tpl=\"21\" href=\"../blog/\" style=\"color: var(--color-neutral-200);\">Blog</a><a data-dc-tpl=\"22\" href=\"../contato/\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"padding: 6px 14px; font-size: 14px;\">Contato</a><span data-dc-tpl=\"23\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"24\" title=\"Português (Brasil)\" style=\"display: flex; padding: 3px; border-radius: 5px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--color-accent-500);\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"25\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Português (Brasil)\" style=\"display: block; width: 22px; height: 16px; background: var(--img-flag-br,url(../assets/ui/flag-br.svg)) center/contain no-repeat;\"></span></span><a data-dc-tpl=\"26\" href=\"../en/about/\" title=\"English (US)\" class=\"scp0\" style=\"display: flex; padding: 3px; border-radius: 5px; opacity: 0.55; transition: opacity 0.2s;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"27\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"English (US)\" style=\"display: block; width: 22px; height: 16px; background: var(--img-flag-us,url(../assets/ui/flag-us.svg)) center/contain no-repeat;\"></span></a></span></div></nav><div data-dc-tpl=\"28\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"height: 56px;\"></div><header data-dc-tpl=\"29\" style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"30\" style=\"position: absolute; right: -200px; top: -260px; width: 900px; height: 700px; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(closest-side,color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-accent-700) 55%,transparent),transparent); animation: 18s ease-in-out 0s infinite normal none running drift; will-change: transform; pointer-events: none;\"></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"31\" style=\"position: relative; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: clamp(64px, 10vw, 120px) clamp(20px, 5vw, 72px) 0px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 420px), 1fr)); align-items: end; gap: 24px 48px;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"32\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px; padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 88px);\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"33\" style=\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); animation: 1s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 0s 1 normal both running rise;\">Sobre a Intelium</span><h1 data-dc-tpl=\"34\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px -0.05em; font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 72px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; max-width: 620px; animation: 1s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 0.15s 1 normal both running rise;\">Não existe IA sem <span data-dc-tpl=\"35\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-300);\">dados em movimento.</span></h1><p data-dc-tpl=\"36\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(16px, 1.6vw, 18px); line-height: 1.6; max-width: 640px; color: var(--color-neutral-200); animation: 1s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 0.35s 1 normal both running rise;\">A Intelium é um centro de excelência em Data Streaming: especialistas em Apache Kafka, Confluent e Real-Time AI. Construímos a infraestrutura de streaming que alimenta modelos preditivos e generativos em tempo real.</p></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"37\" class=\"lighten\" style=\"align-self: end; animation: 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 0.5s 1 normal both running rise;\"><img data-dc-tpl=\"38\" src=\"../assets/time-intelium.webp\" width=\"1300\" height=\"975\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Time Intelium\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 620px; margin-left: auto; mask-image: linear-gradient(rgb(0, 0, 0) 70%, transparent);\"></div></div></header><section data-dc-tpl=\"39\" aria-label=\"Estrutura\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(900px 420px at 85% -40%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-section-glow) 70%,transparent),transparent 64%),var(--color-section);\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"40\" style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 56px clamp(20px, 5vw, 72px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 200px), 1fr)); gap: 32px 24px;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"41\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"42\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.4vw, 44px); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 500;\">CoE</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"43\" style=\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 70%,transparent);\">Centro de Excelência em São Paulo</p></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"44\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"45\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.4vw, 44px); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 500;\">100%</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"46\" style=\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 70%,transparent);\">Do time certificado</p></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"47\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"48\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.4vw, 44px); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 500;\">Global</p><p data-dc-tpl=\"49\" style=\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 70%,transparent);\">Nascida global, com sede em São Paulo</p></div></div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"50\" aria-label=\"Setores\" style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 28px clamp(20px, 5vw, 72px) 0px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px 32px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"51\" style=\"font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-neutral-400);\">Atuamos em</span><div data-dc-tpl=\"52\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 28px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--color-neutral-100);\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"53\">Serviços financeiros</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"54\">Seguros</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"55\">Saúde</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"56\">Varejo</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"57\">Energia</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"58\">Setor público</span></div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"59\" style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: clamp(64px, 8vw, 104px) clamp(20px, 5vw, 72px) 0px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 32px 64px;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"60\" style=\"flex: 1 1 300px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"61\" style=\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent);\">Como trabalhamos</span><h2 data-dc-tpl=\"62\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.015em;\">Forward Deployed Engineers</h2></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"63\" style=\"flex: 2 1 480px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; min-width: 0px;\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"64\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 28px; color: var(--color-neutral-200);\">Engenheiros sêniores trabalham dentro do ambiente do cliente, integrados ao squad, em três fases: Imersão Total, Execução Hands-on e Transferência de Conhecimento. Saímos deixando capacidade instalada, não dependência.</p><a data-dc-tpl=\"65\" href=\"../servicos/#fde\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Ver o modelo FDE →</a></div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"66\" style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: clamp(64px, 8vw, 104px) clamp(20px, 5vw, 72px) 0px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 32px 64px;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"67\" style=\"flex: 1 1 300px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"68\" style=\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent);\">Comunidade</span><h2 data-dc-tpl=\"69\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.015em;\">Especialistas que também estão no palco.</h2></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"70\" style=\"flex: 2 1 480px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; min-width: 0px;\"><p data-dc-tpl=\"71\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 28px; color: var(--color-neutral-200);\">Nossos especialistas são speakers em Data Streaming, impulsionam comunidades locais de Apache Kafka e participam de programas como o Confluent Community Catalyst.</p><a data-dc-tpl=\"72\" href=\"../eventos/\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Ver eventos →</a></div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"73\" style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: clamp(64px, 8vw, 104px) clamp(20px, 5vw, 72px) 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"74\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"75\" style=\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent);\">Valores</span><h2 data-dc-tpl=\"76\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.015em;\">O que orienta cada entrega.</h2></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"77\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, max(clamp(25% - 30px, -99900% + 879120px, 50% - 20px), -99900% + 439560px)), 1fr)); gap: 32px 40px;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"78\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding-top: 20px; background: linear-gradient(to right,var(--color-accent) 0 44px,var(--color-neutral-700) 44px) top/100% 1px no-repeat;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"79\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-accent); font-feature-settings: &quot;tnum&quot;;\">01</span><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"80\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; line-height: 28px;\">Excelência Técnica</h3></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"81\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding-top: 20px; background: linear-gradient(to right,var(--color-accent) 0 44px,var(--color-neutral-700) 44px) top/100% 1px no-repeat;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"82\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-accent); font-feature-settings: &quot;tnum&quot;;\">02</span><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"83\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; line-height: 28px;\">Transparência Radical</h3></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"84\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding-top: 20px; background: linear-gradient(to right,var(--color-accent) 0 44px,var(--color-neutral-700) 44px) top/100% 1px no-repeat;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"85\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-accent); font-feature-settings: &quot;tnum&quot;;\">03</span><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"86\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; line-height: 28px;\">Foco no Cliente</h3></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"87\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding-top: 20px; background: linear-gradient(to right,var(--color-accent) 0 44px,var(--color-neutral-700) 44px) top/100% 1px no-repeat;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"88\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-accent); font-feature-settings: &quot;tnum&quot;;\">04</span><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"89\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; line-height: 28px;\">Aprendizado Contínuo</h3></div></div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"90\" style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: clamp(64px, 8vw, 104px) clamp(20px, 5vw, 72px) 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"91\" style=\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent);\">Marcas</span><div data-dc-tpl=\"92\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 340px), 1fr)); gap: 16px;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"93\" class=\"card scp1\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"94\" class=\"card-kicker\">Intelium Labs</span><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"95\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; line-height: 28px;\">Produtos e frameworks criados pelo nosso time.</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"96\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--color-neutral-300);\">Framework de migração IBM Event Streams → Confluent e Infra Forge, nosso builder automatizado de ambientes Confluent.</p><a data-dc-tpl=\"97\" href=\"../labs/\" style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 6px;\">Ver Labs →</a></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"98\" class=\"card scp1\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"99\" class=\"card-kicker\">Intelium Academy</span><h3 data-dc-tpl=\"100\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; line-height: 28px;\">Formamos a próxima geração de especialistas em Data Streaming.</h3><p data-dc-tpl=\"101\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--color-neutral-300);\">Fundamentos de Apache Kafka: 40h, online e presencial.</p></div></div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"102\" id=\"parceiros\" aria-label=\"Parceiros estratégicos\" style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: clamp(64px, 8vw, 104px) clamp(20px, 5vw, 72px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px; scroll-margin-top: 72px;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"103\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; max-width: 720px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"104\" style=\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent);\">Parceiros estratégicos</span><h2 data-dc-tpl=\"105\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.015em;\">Cada parceiro cobre uma camada do problema.</h2><p data-dc-tpl=\"106\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; color: var(--color-neutral-200);\">Escolhemos poucos parceiros e vamos fundo em cada um. O que você vê abaixo é o que usamos em produção, não uma lista de logos.</p></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"107\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 440px), 1fr)); gap: 16px;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"108\" class=\"card\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; padding: clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 28px);\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"109\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px 16px;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"110\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;\"><img data-dc-tpl=\"111\" src=\"../assets/parceiros/ibm.webp\" alt=\"IBM\" width=\"76\" height=\"28\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display: block; height: 28px; width: auto;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"112\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width: 1px; height: 20px; background: var(--color-neutral-600);\"></span><img data-dc-tpl=\"113\" src=\"../assets/parceiros/confluent.webp\" alt=\"Confluent\" width=\"141\" height=\"28\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display: block; height: 28px; width: auto;\"></div><span data-dc-tpl=\"114\" class=\"tag tag-accent\">IBM Partner · especialistas em IBM Confluent</span></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"115\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"116\" style=\"font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-neutral-400);\">Por que importa</span><p data-dc-tpl=\"117\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--color-neutral-200);\">Com a aquisição da Confluent pela IBM, a plataforma de dados em movimento e o ecossistema de legado crítico do Brasil (MQ, mainframe, Cloud Pak, Event Streams) passam a estar sob o mesmo guarda-chuva. Somos parceiros IBM especializados em IBM Confluent: Kafka gerenciado, Flink, Schema Registry, Connect e Tableflow, em nuvem ou on-prem.</p></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"118\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"119\" style=\"font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-neutral-400);\">O que fazemos juntos</span><ul data-dc-tpl=\"120\" style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><li data-dc-tpl=\"121\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: baseline; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--color-neutral-100);\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"122\" style=\"flex: 0 0 auto; width: 14px; height: 1px; background: var(--color-accent); transform: translateY(-5px);\"></span>Implantação e operação de Confluent Cloud, Platform e Private Cloud</li><li data-dc-tpl=\"123\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: baseline; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--color-neutral-100);\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"124\" style=\"flex: 0 0 auto; width: 14px; height: 1px; background: var(--color-accent); transform: translateY(-5px);\"></span>Desacoplamento de mainframe e MQ via CDC e eventos</li><li data-dc-tpl=\"125\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: baseline; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--color-neutral-100);\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"126\" style=\"flex: 0 0 auto; width: 14px; height: 1px; background: var(--color-accent); transform: translateY(-5px);\"></span>Framework próprio de migração Event Streams → Confluent</li><li data-dc-tpl=\"127\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: baseline; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--color-neutral-100);\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"128\" style=\"flex: 0 0 auto; width: 14px; height: 1px; background: var(--color-accent); transform: translateY(-5px);\"></span>Co-sell e eventos: Kafka Meetup SP, Data In Motion, IBM Think e Tech Summit</li></ul></div></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"129\" class=\"card\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; padding: clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 28px);\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"130\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px 16px;\"><img data-dc-tpl=\"131\" src=\"../assets/parceiros/lenses.webp\" alt=\"Lenses.io\" width=\"107\" height=\"28\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display: block; height: 28px; width: auto;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"132\" class=\"tag tag-accent\">Parceiro de Developer Experience</span></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"133\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"134\" style=\"font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-neutral-400);\">Por que importa</span><p data-dc-tpl=\"135\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--color-neutral-200);\">Lenses é a camada de developer experience para Kafka: uma interface única para explorar tópicos, consultar dados com SQL, catalogar schemas e aplicar governança (RBAC, auditoria, mascaramento) em vários clusters ao mesmo tempo, seja Confluent, MSK ou Kafka open source. Reduz a dependência de scripts e acelera os times que desenvolvem sobre eventos.</p></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"136\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"137\" style=\"font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-neutral-400);\">O que fazemos juntos</span><ul data-dc-tpl=\"138\" style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><li data-dc-tpl=\"139\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: baseline; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--color-neutral-100);\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"140\" style=\"flex: 0 0 auto; width: 14px; height: 1px; background: var(--color-accent); transform: translateY(-5px);\"></span>Observabilidade e troubleshooting de clusters com SQL Studio e alertas</li><li data-dc-tpl=\"141\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: baseline; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--color-neutral-100);\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"142\" style=\"flex: 0 0 auto; width: 14px; height: 1px; background: var(--color-accent); transform: translateY(-5px);\"></span>Governança: catálogo de dados, RBAC, auditoria e políticas de mascaramento</li><li data-dc-tpl=\"143\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: baseline; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--color-neutral-100);\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"144\" style=\"flex: 0 0 auto; width: 14px; height: 1px; background: var(--color-accent); transform: translateY(-5px);\"></span>Operação multi-cluster com Lenses 6 e agentes por ambiente</li><li data-dc-tpl=\"145\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: baseline; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--color-neutral-100);\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"146\" style=\"flex: 0 0 auto; width: 14px; height: 1px; background: var(--color-accent); transform: translateY(-5px);\"></span>Enablement de times de desenvolvimento</li></ul></div></div></div></section><footer data-dc-tpl=\"147\" id=\"contato\" style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px clamp(20px, 5vw, 72px);\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"148\" style=\"height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(to right,transparen